        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="appi" parent="paas" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalAlign=top;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=none;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;fontSize=10;image=https://icons.diagrams.net/assets/azure/1/Application_Insights.svg;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="56" width="56" x="30" y="392" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="appi_t" parent="paas" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5C2A30;" value="&lt;b&gt;Application Insights&lt;/b&gt; · workspace-based · wired only if the app opts in" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="620" x="105" y="398" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="la" parent="paas" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=10;image=img/lib/azure2/analytics/Log_Analytics_Workspaces.svg;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="56" width="56" x="30" y="497" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="la_t" parent="paas" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5C2A30;" value="&lt;b&gt;Log Analytics&lt;/b&gt; · 30 day retention · backs Application Insights only" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="620" x="105" y="503" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mi" parent="paas" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];align=center;fontSize=10;image=img/lib/azure2/identity/Managed_Identities.svg;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="56" width="56" x="30" y="602" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mi_t" parent="paas" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5C2A30;" value="&lt;b&gt;Managed identity&lt;/b&gt; · one, shared by all six apps · get/list on every secret · SQL AAD login" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="620" x="105" y="608" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA3AF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10;fontColor=#374151;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; No private endpoints. SQL, Key Vault and Storage all keep public network access with a default action of Allow; the subnet carries service endpoints only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; The environment is internet-facing (internal = false) and webapi-ui has external ingress, so the UI answers on a public *.azurecontainerapps.io name.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; Key Vault uses access policies rather than RBAC. The template creates no role assignments at all, deliberately, so that it deploys with Contributor alone.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt; One managed identity serves all six apps: searxng, plantuml, docling and documentserver can each read the SQL connection string and the JWT signing key.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; Azure Files mounts authenticate with the storage account key. Shared key access cannot be disabled without breaking them.&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; Container console logs are never ingested (log destination is null) and SQL auditing is disabled, so only the live stream exists and nothing survives a restart.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.&lt;/b&gt; Images are pulled anonymously from public registries on moving tags such as main and latest. There is no container registry in the tenant.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.&lt;/b&gt; Sign-in is first-party JWT only, with no Entra ID. On a fresh database the first account to register becomes an administrator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.&lt;/b&gt; Egress is uncontrolled: searxng reaches upstream search engines, the script agent installs from PyPI and npm at runtime, and docling downloads models at boot.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.&lt;/b&gt; This template has never been deployed — every gate in the deploy ledger is still recorded as pending.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="850" x="350" y="1090" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_browser" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;shape=wire;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;strokeColor=#4A5568;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="a_web" value="HTTPS 443 · public ingress">
